  "sections": [
    {
      "title": "Dilution",
      "excerpt": "DILUTION The\noffering price of the shares of common stock offered hereby is fixed at $0.03 per share. Purchasers of shares in this offering will experience\nimmediate dilution in the net tangible book value of their investment. Dilution represents the difference between the public offering\nprice per share and the net tangible book value per share of our common stock immediately after completion of this offering. Net\ntangible book value represents our total tangible assets less our total liabilities. As of June 30, 2026, our net tangible book value\nwas $18,144, or approximately $0.0043 per share, based upon 4,200,000 shares of common stock outstanding. After\ngiving effect to the sale of all 5,500,000 shares of common stock offered hereby at the public offering price of $0.03 per share, and\nafter deducting estimated offering expenses of approximately $41,023, our pro forma net tangible book",
      "status": "source_excerpt_not_model_conclusion"
    }
  ],
